    "story": {
      "type": "about-story",
      "blocks": {
        "header": {
          "type": "group",
          "settings": {
            "direction": "column",
            "gap": "md"
          },
          "blocks": {
            "eyebrow": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Our story</p>",
                "style": "eyebrow"
              }
            },
            "heading": {
              "type": "heading",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "It started at the clubs",
                "tag": "h2",
                "size": "lg"
              }
            }
          },
          "block_order": [
            "eyebrow",
            "heading"
          ],
          "static": true
        },
        "paragraph-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We started Fencing Club in 2023, after years of visiting clubs, schools, and training halls around the world. Everywhere we went, the same problem: getting proper gear was slow, costly, or a gamble — thin inventory, uneven quality, and prices inflated by long, indirect supply chains.</p>",
            "style": "lead"
          }
        },
        "paragraph-2": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Every visit pointed to one belief: cost and access should never stand between a fencer and the sport.</p>",
            "style": "lead"
          }
        },
        "paragraph-3": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>So we built one dependable, fencing-only shop — gear for every level, sourced direct, priced fairly, and backed by people who fence and answer when you ask.</p>",
            "style": "lead"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "paragraph-1",
        "paragraph-2",
        "paragraph-3"
      ]
    },
    "clubs": {
      "type": "about-clubs",
      "blocks": {
        "header": {
          "type": "group",
          "settings": {
            "direction": "column",
            "gap": "md"
          },
          "blocks": {
            "eyebrow": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Our home pistes, USA Fencing Region 1</p>",
                "style": "eyebrow"
              }
            },
            "heading": {
              "type": "heading",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "The clubs we call home",
                "tag": "h2",
                "size": "lg"
              }
            },
            "intro": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>We're active members at clubs across USA Fencing's Region 1. Most weeks you'll find our team on the piste — fencing épée at Kaizen Academy and Olympic Epee Masters, foil at Rain City Fencing Center, and open fencing at Salle Auriol.</p>",
                "style": "lead"
              }
            }
          },
          "block_order": [
            "eyebrow",
            "heading",
            "intro"
          ],
          "static": true
        },
        "callout": {
          "type": "_clubs-callout",
          "static": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "Free order delivery to our home clubs",
            "text": "Since we train at these clubs too, we'll drop your order off free at Kaizen Academy, Olympic Epee Masters, Rain City Fencing Center, or Salle Auriol."
          }
        },
        "kaizen": {
          "type": "_club",
          "settings": {
            "discipline": "Épée",
